; A bare balance assignment leaves the target less the account's balance
; and its earlier postings in the transaction (src/textual_xacts.cc,
; compute_balance_diff), so the bare 5 against the held $10 also leaves a
; second commodity, the null one, and to_amount rejects the difference
; (src/balance.h:473-480).

2024/01/01 Open
    Assets:A    $10
    Equity:O

2024/01/02 Bare five
    Assets:A    = 5
    Assets:B

test bal -> 1
